```
|= ^ |= a |
| 1 | 2 |
.
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col"></th><th scope="col">a</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
